{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜？」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0062", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……这么想来，只有咱们四个人在一起的情况还挺少见的」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0557", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊～确实是这样呢」", "text_idx": 281, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0288", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……所以总感觉，炒不热气氛？」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0357", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎、哎呀，这个我也不清楚啊」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0289", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「难道说，我们几个其实关系并不好么」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0358", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没有没有没有！」", "text_idx": 289, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0558", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「就是说啊。\\n　我们可是一起在小爱的房间里学习过的交情呢」", "text_idx": 291, "plain": "「就是说啊。　我们可是一起在小爱的房间里学习过的交情呢」", "plain_idx": 292, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0185", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过确实，气氛热不起来呢……」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0290", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「如果只是要聊天的话，话题倒是有不少。\\n　不过……」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": "「如果只是要聊天的话，话题倒是有不少。　不过……」", "plain_idx": 297, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0559", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0359", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "通用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「但是总觉得缺点什么啊……」\\n「但是总觉得还是少了些什么……」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": "「但是总觉得缺点什么啊……」「但是总觉得还是少了些什么……」", "plain_idx": 302, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": "爱理／安洁", "alt_speaker_idx": 300, "voice": "go042", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，少了什么呢……\\n　是少了什么呢，小熊喵，摸摸」", "text_idx": 304, "plain": "「是啊，少了什么呢……　是少了什么呢，小熊喵，摸摸」", "plain_idx": 305, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0186", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜♪　呜溜、呜溜～♪」", "text_idx": 307, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0063", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "通用２", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 248, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": "众人", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "go043", "char_id": "汎用２"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……哥还没来吗」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0361", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「能不能快点过来呢」", "text_idx": 313, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0293", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是啊，要是瓜生在就好了」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0188", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过啊，就算他在，那家伙也不会率先挑起话题的……」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": "「不过啊，就算他在，那家伙也不会率先挑起话题的……」", "plain_idx": 317, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0562", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过……他在干什么呢。\\n　都说了要赶快过来的……」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": "「不过……他在干什么呢。　都说了要赶快过来的……」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0563", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉抱歉、久等了——」", "text_idx": 322, "plain": "「抱歉抱歉、久等了——」", "plain_idx": 322, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「恭候多时了！」", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0294", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「瓜生～在这边～」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0189", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哥」", "text_idx": 327, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0362", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……嗯。\\n　人都齐了，那就开始吧」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": "「……嗯。　人都齐了，那就开始吧」", "plain_idx": 330, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0564", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎，我来说吗？」", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就……大家辛苦了！」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "通用", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「辛苦了～～～～！！」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": "众人", "alt_speaker_idx": 309, "voice": "go044", "char_id": "汎用"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我们用在自动贩卖机买的果汁干了杯。", "text_idx": 337, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "尽管用纸杯干杯发不出声音，\\n不过这里讲究的就是一个气氛。", "text_idx": 338, "plain": "尽管用纸杯干杯发不出声音，不过这里讲究的就是一个气氛。", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀～终于结束了。\\n　啊，喝完之后由安洁来为各位斟上吧，\\n　不过虽然说是斟上其实也就是去自动售货机那再买一瓶而已」", "text_idx": 340, "plain": "「哎呀～终于结束了。　啊，喝完之后由安洁来为各位斟上吧，　不过虽然说是斟上其实也就是去自动售货机那再买一瓶而已」", "plain_idx": 341, "len": 60, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0296", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「所以，最关键的，大家情况如何？」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0566", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜呜！提起这个我就难受」", "text_idx": 345, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0297", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「托你的福，我考得应该还不错吧。\\n　嗯，总之比想象中的好」", "text_idx": 347, "plain": "「托你的福，我考得应该还不错吧。　嗯，总之比想象中的好」", "plain_idx": 348, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 3, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0364", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哎呀，真不愧是结女校啊，出的题相当难啊～」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0160", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都露出事情告一段落的表情。", "text_idx": 353, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在这一点上，不分男女，也不分来自结女校还是各务台学院——\\n但对我来说，空气通畅，让我十分高兴。", "text_idx": 354, "plain": "在这一点上，不分男女，也不分来自结女校还是各务台学院——但对我来说，空气通畅，让我十分高兴。", "plain_idx": 355, "len": 48, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过这一次，比之前来说总觉得\\n　更加轻松呢」", "text_idx": 356, "plain": "「不过这一次，比之前来说总觉得　更加轻松呢」", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0298", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实是……平时该怎么说呢，\\n　气氛都会更加紧张」", "text_idx": 360, "plain": "「确实是……平时该怎么说呢，　气氛都会更加紧张」", "plain_idx": 361, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0104", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "纱凪", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理也是，之前一到快要考试的时候，\\n　就给人一种“敢靠近就杀了你”的感觉」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": "「爱理也是，之前一到快要考试的时候，　就给人一种“敢靠近就杀了你”的感觉」", "plain_idx": 364, "len": 39, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sn0105", "char_id": "紗凪"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要你管啊」", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0567", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呼……」", "text_idx": 368, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「搞不好，\\n　这也是因为各务台学院的同学的到来」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": "「搞不好，　这也是因为各务台学院的同学的到来」", "plain_idx": 370, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0191", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……她能这么说我还是很高兴啊。", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "樱乃", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「也就是说，各务台学院的学生缺乏紧张感」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "sk0365", "char_id": "桜乃"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不对不对不对」", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「缺乏紧张感的只是瓜生，还有椋梨」", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0568", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哇，你来这一手！」", "text_idx": 378, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家都笑了。", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "大家一起笑了。", "text_idx": 380, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "所以，我也开心地笑了。", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过啊……\\n　和平时相比，我可是在好的方面更加紧张了啊」", "text_idx": 382, "plain": "「不过啊……　和平时相比，我可是在好的方面更加紧张了啊」", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你再紧张一些更好」", "text_idx": 384, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0569", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「爱理同学请再松懈一些」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag0299", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我已经很松懈了啊」", "text_idx": 388, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0570", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "濑名同学像校长一样耸了耸肩。", "text_idx": 390, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还是第一次开这种庆功宴」", "text_idx": 391, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0571", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「而且还是大家一起开庆功宴。\\n　真是开心呀」", "text_idx": 393, "plain": "「而且还是大家一起开庆功宴。　真是开心呀」", "plain_idx": 394, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu0192", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～溜～～♪」", "text_idx": 396, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0065", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我深吸了一口气。", "text_idx": 398, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "看了过去。", "text_idx": 399, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*prologue14", "row": 0, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那就……再干一次杯吧」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*prologue14", "row": 1, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么啊」", "text_idx": 415, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0572", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*prologue14", "row": 2, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下来也请多指教，大概这种感觉」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*prologue14", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "——期中考试终于告一段落。", "text_idx": 418, "plain": "——期中考试终于告一段落。", "plain_idx": 418, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*prologue14", "row": 4, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉了啊」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar0573", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_19.txt", "scene": "*prologue14", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我确实感觉到周围的空气变得柔和了。", "text_idx": 421, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
